     4| * Owner mandate 2026-07-19: turn IVX IA from a routing system into a REAL
     5| * senior developer that can independently inspect, edit, test, revise, commit,
     6| * and verify real code changes without Rork authoring the patch.
     7| *
     8| * This engine runs a bounded engineering loop:
     9| *
    10| *   INSPECT → PLAN → PATCH → TEST → ANALYZE → REVISE → VERIFY → COMMIT →
    11| *   AWAIT_OWNER_APPROVAL → DEPLOY → PRODUCTION_VERIFY
